stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> EventFired: Task Marked Done
    EventFired --> CheckGuards: Automation Engine
    
    state CheckGuards {
        [*] --> QueryDescendants
        QueryDescendants --> CheckStatus: Any Subtasks TODO?
        CheckStatus --> Pass: No
        CheckStatus --> Fail: Yes
    }
    
    CheckGuards --> Proceed: Pass
    Proceed --> ExecuteAction: Trigger Webhook / Next Phase
    ExecuteAction --> [*]
    
    CheckGuards --> Cleanup: Fail
    Cleanup --> RevertDatabase: Update Task Status -> TODO
    RevertDatabase --> NotifyUser: Emit SSE (Policy Violation)
    NotifyUser --> [*]
